      "text": "[7:17AM] \n#LagIbdExpWay\n#3MB\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nAs it's expected on Sunday morning, Traffic is very free along the stretch of Lagos-Ibadan Express Way from Kara bridge inward Berger all the way to Iyana Oworo, same as the return journey back to Tollgate and Berger enroute Mowe.\n\nInward and outward of the Third mainland bridge is also unhindered.\n\nPlease maintain within the speed limit and be cautious with your driving to avoid stories that touch.\nLASTMAcares!\n#FollowLASTMA\n@followlasg \n@lagostraffic961 \n@TrafficChiefNG \n@trafficpalava",
